  "headline": "Gibraltar powers and combat philosophy: how strength is framed in Apex Legends",
  "description": "How Gibraltar’s abilities express character and shape the series’ action grammar.",
  "articleBody": "Gibraltar is a forward-driving force in Apex Legends. The point of analysis is not trivia, but repeated choices under pressure.\n\nThis piece stays evergreen: it focuses on patterns in depiction rather than time-sensitive plot claims.\n\n1. Expression: power presentation is a mirror of worldview.\n\n2. Constraints: limits are what create drama, not the power itself.\n\n3. Change: shifts in fighting style usually track shifts in identity.",
